WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.736
I see blue letters.

2
00:00:09.737 --> 00:00:18.069
I see yellow pencils.

3
00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:26.384
I see books.

4
00:00:26.385 --> 00:00:34.722
I see a teacher.

5
00:00:34.723 --> 00:00:43.044
I see a clock.

6
00:00:43.045 --> 00:00:51.369
I see a globe.

7
00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:59.337
I see many desks.

8
00:00:59.338 --> 00:01:07.011
Where am I?

9
00:01:07.012 --> 00:01:14.858
I am at school.

